{"data":{"body":"**[P1] Finalize close-time plugin fatals as `RETRYING`.** This check runs after `ExecutionManager.close()` has released the plugins. If scope cleanup or a checkpoint hook reports a fatal during shutdown, the caller retries while plugins retain the earlier `PENDING`/`SUCCEEDED` outcome and cannot receive the fatal. Defer the single end-hook dispatch and release until shutdown settles, and require the shutdown-window test to observe one `RETRYING` end carrying the original error.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc74rLL8","finding_digest":"8be69537d7226d4ace1dfef289a46b28f9e5175206d90fffc1bd85e48ff10825","finding_id":"arf_v1_rptjkn6xejwuvtq573zitjdlfd","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-finalization-bypass","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::awaithandlerscopes::fatal-finalization-bypass","line":285,"observation_digest":"92ede5359c46a8c38eabe0c783a3409c8774dc593e3b0da050179e435558924b","observation_id":"aro_v1_slw6knm4i2umhdvl4ddyhi2ats","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_rptjkn6xejwuvtq573zitjdlfd","published_at":"2026-10-03T06:52:49Z","review_id":"arr_v1_nnq557wot6h6dzssirniq6wdt3","reviewed_base_sha":"61f5d103651c2bafc54f840a539cf55a95f47df7","reviewed_head_sha":"a4cc6d2e9a7a6880e8bf73b87c9c3b10fcba5715","reviewer":"codex","start_line":285,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_rv5x5uzlunfupqvq4bd2qw5epp","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T06:52:49Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
